+/*
+ * A 4K@60Hz mode at 12 bpc needs 24.057 Gbps, i.e. the 8 Gbps x 4 lanes
+ * configuration, so both a rate above the source limit and one below what
+ * the mode requires have to end up on a usable configuration.
