+	select V4L2_H264
+	select V4L2_H264_ENC
+	select V4L2_HEVC_ENC
+	help
+	  Support for the VEPU580 (RKVENC) video encoder of the Rockchip
+	  RK3588, using the V4L2 stateless encoder interface. H.264 and
+	  HEVC are supported.
